1
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:07,660
=Bionic Trace=

2
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:10,620
=Episode 17=

3
00:01:10,910 --> 00:01:12,080
How many of

4
00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:13,230
Liu Guanghai's memories have you read?

5
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:14,510
Several.

6
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,080
But

7
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:16,950
I lost

8
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:18,950
some of them during a previous episode.

9
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:20,480
You lost them?

10
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:21,120
Yes.

11
00:01:22,590 --> 00:01:23,360
Okay.

12
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:26,160
Who was the fourth person
Liu Guanghai intended to kill?

13
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:27,950
The fourth person?

14
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:28,870
Yes.

15
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,080
Uncle Hai.

16
00:01:34,270 --> 00:01:35,800
Then keep it as a souvenir.

17
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:37,680
And this necklace, too.

18
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:41,800
The fourth.

19
00:01:43,510 --> 00:01:44,590
I still have to kill one more.

20
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:45,400
I still have to kill one more.

21
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,160
One more.

22
00:01:46,950 --> 00:01:48,080
Otherwise, Siqi's

23
00:01:48,270 --> 00:01:49,590
eyesight would have been lost for nothing.

24
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,120
Song Yang.

25
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:52,720
I think I need to deal with...

26
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:57,550
Wait.

27
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:01,830
I have something to do.

28
00:02:02,010 --> 00:02:03,040
I have to go.

29
00:02:03,550 --> 00:02:04,160
Hey, you...

30
00:02:08,190 --> 00:02:09,440
Are you okay, Song Yang?

31
00:02:09,830 --> 00:02:10,600
I'm fine.

32
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,190
Why did you let him escape?

33
00:02:12,270 --> 00:02:13,190
It's okay.

34
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:14,270
But we need to

35
00:02:14,270 --> 00:02:15,270
move somewhere else quickly.

36
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:17,030
I wonder if he recognized you just now.

37
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,110
Hmm.

38
00:02:35,670 --> 00:02:36,440
Siqi.

39
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:38,660
You can call me Ada.

40
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,270
Thank you,

41
00:02:41,270 --> 00:02:42,320
Ms. Ada.

42
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,600
I'm sorry.

43
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:44,750
Your teachers couldn't come

44
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:46,470
because of their teaching duties.

45
00:02:47,110 --> 00:02:48,880
But they asked me to send their regards.

46
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:51,360
They hope you can return to school soon.

47
00:02:51,470 --> 00:02:52,910
Even if I leave the hospital,

48
00:02:53,190 --> 00:02:55,110
I can't go back to my old school.

49
00:02:55,390 --> 00:02:56,600
Right now,

50
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:58,160
I'm working hard to learn Braille.

51
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:00,420
It's much harder than math.

52
00:03:02,550 --> 00:03:04,550
Actually, you could get
bionic eyes someday

53
00:03:04,830 --> 00:03:06,670
and live a normal life.

54
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,550
The surgery

55
00:03:08,550 --> 00:03:10,600
and subsequent treatment

56
00:03:10,750 --> 00:03:12,440
have drained our family's savings.

57
00:03:12,670 --> 00:03:13,520
Teacher.

58
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:16,470
I can't afford bionic eyes.

59
00:03:17,390 --> 00:03:18,960
(Liu Siqi completely believes)

60
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,800
(you're one of her
middle school teachers.)

61
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:21,550
(Ada.)

62
00:03:21,670 --> 00:03:23,270
(Steer the conversation
toward Liu Guanghai.)

63
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:27,390
Actually, with today's
medical technology,

64
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,240
you could choose a more
advanced surgical procedure.

65
00:03:30,630 --> 00:03:32,390
Why did your father choose this one?

66
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,600
A better procedure

67
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:36,160
would cost more money.

68
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:38,880
Dad has been trying
so hard to raise the money.

69
00:03:39,270 --> 00:03:40,630
But

70
00:03:40,630 --> 00:03:42,520
the cancer cells spread too quickly.

71
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:44,160
It was already too late.

72
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,960
So that's why Liu Guanghai

73
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,670
gouged out the victims' eyes.

74
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,750
He was seeking revenge for his daughter.

75
00:03:55,270 --> 00:03:56,360
Siqi.

76
00:03:57,270 --> 00:03:58,440
Have you seen

77
00:03:58,440 --> 00:03:59,360
your father recently?

78
00:03:59,670 --> 00:04:00,830
No.

79
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:02,270
Lately,

80
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:04,360
only Mingxuan has been visiting me.

81
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:06,720
He's someone I met

82
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:07,960
on an online book forum.

83
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,190
I never expected

84
00:04:09,390 --> 00:04:10,670
him to be a writer, too.

85
00:04:10,830 --> 00:04:11,830
(Zhang Mingxuan probably)

86
00:04:11,830 --> 00:04:13,080
(lied to conceal)

87
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:13,720
(the real reason.)

88
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:14,960
(He must have been influenced)

89
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,270
(by Liu Guanghai's memories)

90
00:04:16,270 --> 00:04:17,440
(and that's why he visited Liu Siqi.)

91
00:04:17,830 --> 00:04:18,670
But

92
00:04:18,790 --> 00:04:19,550
Dad sends money

93
00:04:19,550 --> 00:04:21,070
to the hospital every month

94
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:23,270
to cover my ongoing treatment.

95
00:04:23,390 --> 00:04:24,880
Dad must be working

96
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,720
somewhere to support me.

97
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,070
He can't get away from work.

98
00:04:28,350 --> 00:04:30,000
That's why he hasn't visited.

99
00:04:32,070 --> 00:04:32,720
I see.

100
00:04:33,230 --> 00:04:34,390
I understand, Siqi.

101
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,760
I need to step outside and make a call.

102
00:04:36,950 --> 00:04:38,720
Okay, Ms. Ada.

103
00:04:49,270 --> 00:04:51,320
Liu Siqi doesn't seem to be lying.

104
00:04:52,230 --> 00:04:54,350
I never imagined that someone
who stole from Cedar

105
00:04:54,350 --> 00:04:56,040
and then brutally murdered

106
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,110
three people

107
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,350
could have done it all for his daughter.

108
00:05:00,950 --> 00:05:02,390
Humans are far more

109
00:05:02,390 --> 00:05:03,670
complex than I imagined.

110
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:05,950
Song Yang.

111
00:05:07,950 --> 00:05:09,270
Something feels very strange.

112
00:05:10,950 --> 00:05:11,950
I might need you

113
00:05:11,950 --> 00:05:13,830
to give me a full
diagnostic check later.

114
00:05:15,070 --> 00:05:17,270
Like when Zhou Zi'an was taken away?

115
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,230
Yes.

116
00:05:20,550 --> 00:05:22,790
There may be something wrong
with one of my parts.

117
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:36,180
(ENCRYPTED SYSTEM ADA)

118
00:05:38,830 --> 00:05:39,580
Ada.

119
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:41,960
Are you

120
00:05:42,830 --> 00:05:43,740
feeling sad?

121
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:47,760
Where's Liu Siqi from Bed 20?

122
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:49,000
Why is she missing?

123
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:06,900
(Identity unrecognized)

124
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,510
Zhang Mingxuan?

125
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:11,070
Ada.

126
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:12,440
They've already left the hospital

127
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:14,040
and are heading toward
a less crowded area.

128
00:06:17,830 --> 00:06:19,230
I've sent you their location.

129
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:20,600
(Got it.)

130
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:35,510
This...

131
00:06:37,670 --> 00:06:38,480
Mingxuan.

132
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,670
Where are you taking me?

133
00:06:39,830 --> 00:06:40,480
Siqi.

134
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,070
Someone is after you.

135
00:06:42,270 --> 00:06:43,350
I'm taking you somewhere safe.

136
00:06:43,350 --> 00:06:44,070
After me?

137
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:45,440
I don't understand what you're saying.

138
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,230
Mingxuan.

139
00:06:46,230 --> 00:06:46,950
I want to go back to the hospital.

140
00:06:47,070 --> 00:06:48,440
I have tests this afternoon.

141
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,510
Come with me.

142
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,070
I'll take you

143
00:06:50,070 --> 00:06:50,830
- somewhere safe.
- I want to go back.

144
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:51,760
- Come on, let's go.
- I want to go back.

145
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:52,600
I can protect you.

146
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:54,440
- I want to go back.
- I can protect you.

147
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,160
Listen to me.

148
00:07:10,270 --> 00:07:11,390
You're safe now.

149
00:07:14,230 --> 00:07:15,000
Who's there?

150
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:17,320
Liu Guanghai.

151
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:18,760
Where are you taking my daughter?

152
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:20,040
You're Liu Guanghai?

153
00:07:21,390 --> 00:07:22,230
Then who am I?

154
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:30,950
Tell me.

155
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,110
Tell me!

156
00:07:32,110 --> 00:07:33,720
Who am I?

157
00:07:41,070 --> 00:07:42,440
Die!

158
00:07:43,790 --> 00:07:45,000
Today,

159
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:46,670
I'm taking Siqi with me.

160
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:48,110
I'll kill you!

161
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,830
I want you dead!

162
00:08:41,550 --> 00:08:43,280
Liu Siqi is only
temporarily unconscious.

163
00:08:43,350 --> 00:08:45,150
But you need treatment immediately.

164
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,400
Thank you, young lady.

165
00:08:48,230 --> 00:08:49,760
I don't understand
what's happening here.

166
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,790
What exactly happened?

167
00:08:53,910 --> 00:08:54,880
(Ada.)

168
00:08:55,350 --> 00:08:56,320
It's up to you

169
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:58,000
whether to tell him the truth.

170
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,910
Hello, Mr. Liu.

171
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:05,840
I'm an X22 android from Cedar Group.

172
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,200
Cedar Group sent me

173
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,520
to investigate the theft

174
00:09:09,150 --> 00:09:11,000
and the three murders you committed.

175
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:13,710
I see.

176
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:15,880
Who is he?

177
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,710
Why was he taking my daughter away?

178
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,760
Did you ever deal with the black market?

179
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,150
Most of what I stole

180
00:09:24,350 --> 00:09:26,080
was sold on the black market.

181
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,670
They secretly copied

182
00:09:28,670 --> 00:09:29,790
your memories of the murders

183
00:09:29,790 --> 00:09:30,470
and sold them to

184
00:09:30,470 --> 00:09:32,000
this novelist looking for inspiration.

185
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:34,150
Your memories took over his mind,

186
00:09:34,350 --> 00:09:35,200
causing problems

187
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:36,400
with his mental state.

188
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:41,200
It seems I'm the one

189
00:09:41,550 --> 00:09:43,030
who harmed this young man.

190
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:44,350
Mr. Liu.

191
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,910
You're very different
from what I imagined.

192
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:48,840
Someone who brutally

193
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,550
murdered three people

194
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,590
turns out to be...

195
00:09:54,710 --> 00:09:55,550
A father.

196
00:10:05,340 --> 00:10:09,020
(City Electronic Intelligence Board)

197
00:10:11,150 --> 00:10:11,640
Captain Deng.

198
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:12,470
We've made a breakthrough.

199
00:10:12,710 --> 00:10:13,960
As you instructed,

200
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,880
we abandoned the existing
networked systems

201
00:10:15,880 --> 00:10:17,760
and manually checked

202
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:19,320
every possible surveillance source.

203
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,910
And we actually found a lead.

204
00:10:21,110 --> 00:10:21,760
What kind of source?

205
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:24,080
It's a security camera

206
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:25,710
outside an old-fashioned hardware store.

207
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:27,400
Here's the key, Captain Deng.

208
00:10:28,150 --> 00:10:30,350
(City Electronic Intelligence Board)
It uses an analog signal,

209
00:10:30,550 --> 00:10:32,000
and all its data

210
00:10:32,110 --> 00:10:33,910
is stored on a local hard drive.

211
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,550
No matter how skilled Song Yang is,

212
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:37,400
he can't hack into something

213
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:38,910
that physically can't connect
to the internet.

214
00:10:39,350 --> 00:10:41,350
He can hack into every digital camera,

215
00:10:42,790 --> 00:10:44,840
but he forgot about the most basic kind.

216
00:10:47,230 --> 00:10:48,200
What else did you find?

217
00:10:49,470 --> 00:10:50,840
The officers conducting the search

218
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:52,080
have uploaded the footage
through an encrypted network.

219
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,400
Just ten minutes ago.

220
00:10:56,940 --> 00:10:57,340
(Match)

221
00:10:58,350 --> 00:10:59,150
Ada?

222
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,520
There's a surveillance blind spot ahead.

223
00:11:03,150 --> 00:11:03,910
Ada.

224
00:11:06,300 --> 00:11:08,140
(Accomplice)

225
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,520
Attention, all units.

226
00:11:12,710 --> 00:11:13,640
Song Yang's accomplice,

227
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:15,150
the android Ada, has been located.

228
00:11:15,230 --> 00:11:16,760
Her position is east

229
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:17,670
of Third Municipal People's Hospital.

230
00:11:17,910 --> 00:11:18,760
Tactical team,

231
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,000
move out immediately.

232
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:23,350
Ada.

233
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,320
Emergency.

234
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:26,000
The police have just ordered
a deployment.

235
00:11:26,150 --> 00:11:27,320
You're their target.

236
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,760
They'll arrive in two minutes at most.

237
00:11:28,760 --> 00:11:29,670
Leave immediately.

238
00:11:30,790 --> 00:11:31,350
Understood.

239
00:11:31,470 --> 00:11:32,910
But Liu Guanghai...

240
00:11:33,280 --> 00:11:34,880
There's no time.
Your safety comes first.

241
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:35,520
Go.

242
00:11:36,470 --> 00:11:38,110
Mr. Liu, the police are coming.

243
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:38,640
I have to...

244
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:39,320
Wait.

245
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:41,960
I can't be arrested in front of Siqi.

246
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:43,080
When the police arrive,

247
00:11:43,150 --> 00:11:44,520
she'll be safe.

248
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:45,840
Android.

249
00:11:46,150 --> 00:11:47,280
Get me out of here.

250
00:11:47,520 --> 00:11:49,280
I'll tell you everything

251
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:50,440
I know.

252
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:51,520
We need to hurry.

253
00:11:51,590 --> 00:11:52,200
Ada.

254
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:54,400
Come with me, quickly.

255
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:00,440
Siqi.

256
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:01,440
There's no time.

257
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:28,560
♪I'm the one who's broken♪

258
00:12:29,390 --> 00:12:34,260
♪Calm, ordinary, and reckless♪

259
00:12:34,300 --> 00:12:37,170
♪That's me, too♪

260
00:12:38,710 --> 00:12:42,230
♪Carefully sketching
and shaping every detail♪

261
00:12:43,060 --> 00:12:46,530
♪Laughter and tears make life feel real♪

262
00:12:47,150 --> 00:12:50,940
♪Don't fear that it's not worth it.
Just be brave♪

263
00:12:51,260 --> 00:12:53,790
♪And learn from your mistakes♪

264
00:12:55,730 --> 00:12:58,390
♪If the human heart
is impossible to fathom♪

265
00:12:58,390 --> 00:13:00,520
♪Could selling my soul and body♪

266
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:03,690
♪Bring me something more?♪

267
00:13:04,390 --> 00:13:11,120
♪Stroke by stroke,
I draw the perfect outline♪

268
00:13:11,950 --> 00:13:15,350
♪Sadness is blue♪

269
00:13:16,330 --> 00:13:19,570
♪How would you paint me?♪

270
00:13:20,570 --> 00:13:24,300
♪Layering, crossing, blending endlessly♪

271
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:26,560
♪Painting without restraint♪

272
00:13:26,750 --> 00:13:29,340
♪Covering the person I used to be♪

273
00:13:29,340 --> 00:13:33,530
♪If I could start over♪

274
00:13:33,700 --> 00:13:37,600
♪I'd show more feeling
in every look and gesture♪

275
00:13:37,710 --> 00:13:40,350
♪Give me back my smile♪

276
00:13:40,950 --> 00:13:43,430
♪Find joy even in hardship♪

277
00:13:43,930 --> 00:13:49,170
♪Don't let the next version of me
be left with nothing♪
